-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party content

ontology/ is not a copy but a git submodule: a reference to one commit of the
agrifooddata ontology (https://github.com/NaLamKI/ontology,
https://ontology.agrifooddata.org), published by NaLamKI under CC BY 4.0 with
its own attribution of the BVL data in its schemes crops, pests and phenology.

The examples take a crop label and its code (examples/CodeMapping.json) and
the name and registration number of a plant protection product
(examples/Product.json) from the plant protection product interface of the
German Federal Office of Consumer Protection and Food Safety (BVL), which may
be used free of charge under § 10 of the German Data Use Act. The prescribed
attribution reads, in German:

    BUNDESAMT FÜR VERBRAUCHERSCHUTZ UND LEBENSMITTELSICHERHEIT (BVL) 2026:
    [https://psm-api.bvl.bund.de/], Stand 2026-09-02

Concepts under http://aims.fao.org/aos/agrovoc/ are AGROVOC identifiers of the
FAO; no AGROVOC labels are redistributed here.
